{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1000_039kon", "source_sha256": "1b01200072627d31ad40b6869fbc32bd69f4f213e1107c69e468a9525f903fcc", "ja": "あ、いたいた。{$P$}、\nちょっとお邪魔するわね！", "zh": "啊，找到了找到了。{$P$}，\n我来打扰一下哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3e3523fd26d682a013c5bb2aaa5ffee8143f6da4b5965210c370328931196924", "ja": "このみさん！？　今日はお休みじゃ……。\nというか、すごくオシャレなような？", "zh": "这个……是木实小姐！？今天不是休息日吗……\n话说回来，感觉特别时髦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "4afc2bdf58017fd7505087dd729571436440e79d76aeed0b67d878f39c06fe8e", "ja": "うふふ……わかる？\nどう、{$P$}から見て、この服は？", "zh": "呵呵……看得出来吗？\n{$P$}先生觉得，这身衣服怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3f6b7d3c9b5008688ab9eb8b2ceec81e16e139837483b4da10977ac396b3552e", "ja": "はい、すごくアダルティです！", "zh": "是的，非常成熟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "46ed2e196a87646821b703e1e207371fc741308b3e20acf189fd1ea57581ef8f", "ja": "そうでしょそうでしょ♪　ほんと困るわよね……\n休日でも、こうして溢れちゃうみたい。", "zh": "就是嘛就是嘛♪ 真是让人伤脑筋呢……\n好像就算是休息日，也会像这样满溢出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9b97c6e686622c2cd7b93c1c8d3e6c6700e930e72f34fda6292dd124c52453b7", "ja": "さすがですね、このみさん。\nもしかして、どこかにお出かけですか？", "zh": "不愧是您啊，木实小姐。难道您是要出门吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "67cd5c99d69f4407f908b4240e9dd789358a2fce6cb37daf46c74d6e0c5e85a3", "ja": "そうそう。実はね、両親が観光に来てるの。\nこの後、妹も合流して食事をする予定で……。", "zh": "对对。其实啊，我父母来这边旅游了。\n待会儿妹妹也会过来，打算一起吃饭……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "c9d2af1916f63843e40729aacf7acc7dd9bb60547cc76eaf348eb48476dc1ac0", "ja": "ううっ……見栄を張って、オシャレなお店を\n予約しちゃったの。だからこの服は、覚悟みたいな？", "zh": "呜呜……我一时爱面子，订了家很时髦的店。所以穿成这样，算是做好心理准备了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "38555e2926c31f4bac9c90ac3ede47a61d61f15582bebd484639fa7a3ce5964c", "ja": "まあ、家族に会うのも久しぶりだし……\n元気でやってる姿を見せるのにもいいかなって。", "zh": "也是，好久没见家人了……\n想着让他们看看我过得很好，或许也不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1009_p", "source_sha256": "875ed42bd7946e1b7e733a5aebda1b6c89f1ae6a77e92592dbc3770bd641f22a", "ja": "そうでしたか。\nあれ？　食事に行くならどうして、ここに……？", "zh": "原来是这样。\n咦？如果要去吃饭，为什么会来到这里……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "1be874ab69450c6667e7a16737fda3ec0d1f24911483b254bcf0b05863b87509", "ja": "それなんだけど……。{$P$}、\nちょっとこっちに来てくれる？　あ、少ししゃがんで。", "zh": "是这样的……{$P$}，\n能到这边来一下吗？啊，稍微蹲下一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1011_p", "source_sha256": "dae5f30f9ff8e01065fad70782e2312980fca9bb7498bf792cf51d1d8302492f", "ja": "え？　はい、わかりました……。", "zh": "咦？好的，我知道了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1012_se", "source_sha256": "9a3e9215594bd0e1c3c47c2a673ca2e84b32a01ec364a487c8bb2abf1de6e1fd", "ja": "パシャッ", "zh": "咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "a0661d3813384aed6644aec2c07ea418efdb6c6468d6fc4ddfc41cced15e38e5", "ja": "うん、これでオッケー♪　いい表情してるわね。", "zh": "嗯，这样就行啦♪表情很不错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1014_p", "source_sha256": "088cf088264da82f8abf58dafa3510da6f24b2d30c2bb91b6571be6314a16e30", "ja": "えっと……このみさん？　ツーショット写真を\n撮った理由を教えてもらえますか……？", "zh": "那个……这张双人合照，是吗？能告诉我拍照的理由吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "c574115814571ff1701bb2ce9755ef92e8bd21ffc5e3bd276546b01019eb69ce", "ja": "急にごめんなさい。両親がね、\n{$P$}のことを知りたいみたいで。", "zh": "这么突然真不好意思。我父母他们，\n好像想了解一下{$P$}呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "6166fc0a6addc52ee255992f26c1701a14246f31081f170e9673e2029e072620", "ja": "まったく……。もう立派な大人なんだけどね。\n親はいつまでも子ども扱いするんだから。", "zh": "真是的……明明已经是个出色的大人了。\n父母却总是把我当成小孩子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1017_p", "source_sha256": "598ce9d74aca9324708a09acd095e0c8e7714de50ddd0325e3a78c08f8e1ef63", "ja": "ははっ、いいじゃないですか。\nご両親も、このみさんのことが心配なんだと思います。", "zh": "哈哈，这不是挺好的吗？我想，叔叔阿姨也是担心您的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "50a0d6d028479d95c4811b25f163e61c792b31c0c6f339c7faecdf1de8d15077", "ja": "そうね……。私としては、嬉しい反面、\nちょっと戸惑うところもあるけど……。", "zh": "是啊……对我来说，虽然很开心，但也有点不知所措……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1019_p", "source_sha256": "ddbaf642d90dd2a206db2d5ffe56804c345a12b60a657e5f66b6832baa20dd5c", "ja": "今のこのみさんを見たら、きっと安心しますよ。\nあっ。ご両親に、よろしくお伝えください。", "zh": "现在如果让叔叔阿姨看到这样的木实小姐，一定会放心的。\n啊，请代我向您的父母问好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "ec42523f9cf2d2123419ad018fdb4995d74e30479520566584991a972c551a63", "ja": "任せて♪　この写真を見れば、\n私たちが信頼し合ってるってわかると思うし。", "zh": "交给我吧♪ 看了这张照片，他们应该就能明白我们彼此信赖了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_039kon0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_039kon0474_1021_039kon", "source_sha256": "c42dd6127b0cfac2eb375d2bc5f4744e830d923f205eb1b00272641b9e1b1577", "ja": "{$P$}は頼りになる、素敵な人だって\n……両親にもしっかり伝えておくわ、うふふ♪", "zh": "我会好好跟父母说的，就说{$P$}是个可靠又优秀的人……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
